OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1785858502
OL,3,CNew heat health alerts issued with
OL,4,Chighs of 35C forecast in some areas
OL,6,FNew heat health alerts are set to come
OL,7,Finto force for large parts of England
OL,8,Fon Monday, with some areas forecast to
OL,9,Fbe hotter than Greek holiday hotspots.
OL,11,FTemperatures could reach 35C in the
OL,12,FSouth East tomorrow, according to the
OL,13,FMet Office, higher than forecasts for
OL,14,Fthe islands of Mykonos, Rhodes and
OL,15,FSantorini.
OL,17,FMuch of central and southern England
OL,18,Fis set to see highs in the upper 20s
OL,19,Fto low 30s before temperatures ease
OL,20,Fslightly later in the week.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
