PN,31802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1785858502
OL,3,CNew heat health alerts issued with
OL,4,Chighs of 35C forecast in some areas
OL,6,FThe UK Health Security Agency (UKHSA)
OL,7,Fhas issued amber heat-health alerts
OL,8,Ffor the East Midlands, East of
OL,9,FEngland, South East and London from
OL,10,FMonday until Wednesday morning.
OL,12,FThe alert warns the heat could place
OL,13,Fextra pressure on the NHS, with more
OL,14,Fvulnerable people likely to require
OL,15,Fmedical treatment.
OL,17,FYellow heat-health alerts will be in
OL,18,Fplace for the North West, Yorkshire
OL,19,Fand The Humber, West Midlands and
OL,20,FSouth West over the same period.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
