FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1785858502
OL,3,CNew heat health alerts issued with
OL,4,Chighs of 35C forecast in some areas
OL,6,FMet Office forecaster Marco Petagna
OL,7,Fsaid: "We're going with a headline
OL,8,Ftomorrow of 34C, but with a potential
OL,9,Ffor local 35C in the South East, the
OL,10,FMidlands into the low 30s as well.
OL,12,F"So central and southern England,
OL,13,Fwidely high 20s to low 30s, and
OL,14,Fapproaching or if not touching, the
OL,15,Fmid 30s in the South East.
OL,17,F"Tomorrow is the peak of the heat;
OL,18,Ftemperatures do come down a little
OL,19,Fbit, we're still talking 28 to 30C on
OL,20,FTuesday.
OL,26,@oD@GOUtD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1785858502
OL,3,CNew heat health alerts issued with
OL,4,Chighs of 35C forecast in some areas
OL,6,F"Again, the South East and East Anglia
OL,7,Fwe're seeing the highest temperatures
OL,8,Fon Tuesday, so not as extreme as
OL,9,Ftomorrow, but still well above
OL,10,Faverage. And then even by Wednesday,
OL,11,Fwe're looking at high 20s, 26 or 27C,
OL,12,Fin the South East.
OL,14,F"But it's a gradual cooling down
OL,15,Fprocess through the week, and always
OL,16,Fcooler towards the North and West in
OL,17,Fany case, high teens, low 20s, but
OL,18,Fcertainly central and South East
OL,19,FEngland seeing hot weather returning
OL,20,Fbriefly, and a lot of sunshine to come
OL,21,Fin the South East as well."
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOU}D@[O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
