PN,31805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1785858502
OL,3,CNew heat health alerts issued with
OL,4,Chighs of 35C forecast in some areas
OL,6,FMr Petagna said low pressure moving in
OL,7,Ffrom the west could bring rain to
OL,8,Fnorthern and western parts of the UK,
OL,9,Fwith a chance of showers reaching the
OL,10,FSouth East on Tuesday and Wednesday.
OL,12,FParts of Scotland and Northern Ireland
OL,13,Fcould see heavy rain, with weather
OL,14,Fwarnings possible in parts of Scotland.
OL,16,FWales is forecast to reach the high
OL,17,F20s on Monday before cooling to the
OL,18,Fmid-20s over the following days, he
OL,19,Fadded.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
